			"Message": "docs(Land): Align build instructions and synchronize submodules\n\nUpdate CONTRIBUTING.md and README.md to reflect the standardized two-step linear build flow: compiling the VS Code source in Dependency/Microsoft/Dependency/Editor using Node 22 and the `dum` tooling, followed by building the Land application via the Maintain/Debug/Build.sh script. Reformat code blocks for readability and reinforce the prohibition of recursive submodule cloning, clarifying that each dependency is managed independently on its own branch.\n\nSynchronize the Dependency submodule to 9260645 to import these build clarifications directly into the VS Code source context.\n\nSynchronize the Element submodule to ae4758ac to integrate critical runtime alignments: regenerate Cocoon build artifacts, restore Mountain feature flags for tier-gating and LSEnvironment, activate Output plugins for macOS titlebar and z-index safety, update Sky dependencies, and regenerate Wind command/service catalogs.\n\nThese changes ensure developer onboarding accuracy, prevent state corruption during upstream synchronization, and align the native backend and UI layers with the latest architectural requirements.",
